# Frontend runtime endpoints (optional)
#
# Defaults (no file needed):
# - When running locally on your PC: uses http://localhost:3001 + ws://localhost:3001
# - When a friend opens your Vite dev server via LAN IP (http://<your-ip>:5173):
#   auto-uses http://<your-ip>:3001 + ws://<your-ip>:3001
#
# If you deploy the backend, set these to point to it:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://your-backend.example/api
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://your-backend.example
